		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Feature request: no collisions w\ objects on hidden layers]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=423#p423"><![CDATA[
From what I can tell, if you have objects on layers which are hidden, objects on the visible layers will collide with them. It would be nice if anything on a hidden layer doesn't contribute to collisions, since that's an easy way of simplifying collision calculations without deleting or modifying objects.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=340">nichg</a> — Wed Nov 02, 2005 1:57 am</p><hr />
